is.CellBases","Breakdown.CellCert.CellAnalysis.CellBox","Breakdown.CellCert.CellAnalysis.CellBox.lineWeight","Breakdown.CellCert.CellAnalysis.CellBox.rect","Breakdown.CellCert.CellAnalysis.IsCellBases","Breakdown.CellCert.CellAnalysis.IsCellBox","Breakdown.CertCell.CellCalculus.IsBivariatePoly","Breakdown.CertCell.CellCalculus.basisValue"],"used_by":["Breakdown.CertCell.CellCalculus.RowLow.Internal.cell_block","Breakdown.CertCell.CellCalculus.RowLow.Internal.cell_expand_pairing","Breakdown.CertCell.CellCalculus.RowLow.Internal.rowLow_core","Breakdown.CertCell.CellCalculus.RowLow.Internal.strain_block_data","Breakdown.CertCell.CellCalculus.RowLow.Internal.vel_block_data","Breakdown.CertCell.CellCalculus.cellBasisExpansion","Breakdown.CertCell.CellCalculus.rowLowPart_of_parts"],"uses":["Breakdown.CellCert.CellAnalysis.CellBases","Breakdown.CellCert.CellAnalysis.CellBox","Breakdown.CellCert.CellAnalysis.CellBox.lineWeight","Breakdown.CellCert.CellAnalysis.CellBox.rect","Breakdown.CellCert.CellAnalysis.IsCellBases","Breakdown.CellCert.CellAnalysis.IsCellBox","Breakdown.CertCell.CellCalculus.IsBivariatePoly","Breakdown.CertCell.CellCalculus.basisValue"],"written":"CellBasisExpansionStatement"}],"imports":["Breakdown.CertCell.RowProfileDefs"],"module":"Breakdown.CertCell.RowLowPartBasisDefs","path":"Breakdown/CertCell/RowLowPartBasisDefs.lean","sha256":"4592751f7425846d3452a351cab2a0744c857cbea1990dda39618787df67efb4","source":"import Breakdown.CertCell.RowProfileDefs\n\nopen MeasureTheory Set\n\nnoncomputable section\n\nnamespace Breakdown\n\nnamespace CertCell\n\nnamespace CellCalculus\n\nopen SteadyCert CellCert CellCert.CellAnalysis CellCert.CellFormula\n\ndef IsBivariatePoly (M N : ℕ) (h : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ) : Prop :=\n  ∃ a : ℕ → ℕ → ℂ, ∀ p : ℝ × ℝ,\n    h p = ∑ i ∈ Finset.range M, ∑ k ∈ Finset.range N, a i k * (p.1 : ℂ) ^ i * (p.2 : ℂ) ^ k\n\ndef IsUnivariatePoly (N : ℕ) (f : ℝ → ℂ) : Prop :=\n  ∃ a : ℕ → ℂ, ∀ u : ℝ, f u = ∑ i ∈ Finset.range N, a i * (u : ℂ) ^ i\n\ndef SegmentTestExpansionStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ (S : FaceSegment) (N : ℕ), (∀ d, S.testCoef d d ≠ 0) →\n    (∀ d d', d < N → d' < N →\n      ∫ u in Set.Icc S.lo S.hi, S.test d u * S.test d' u = if d = d' then 1 else 0) →\n    ∀ f : ℝ → ℂ, IsUnivariatePoly N f →\n      ∀ u : ℝ, f u = ∑ d ∈ Finset.range N, (∫ w in Set.Icc S.lo S.hi, f w * (S.test d w : ℂ)) * (S.test d u : ℂ)\n\ndef CellBasisExpansionStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ (K : CellBox) (B : CellBases), IsCellBox K → IsCellBases K B →\n    ∀ (N : ℕ) (h : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ), IsBivariatePoly N N h →\n      ∀ p : ℝ × ℝ, h p = ∑ j ∈ Finset.range N, ∑ l ∈ Finset.range N,\n        (∫ x in K.rect, (K.lineWeight x.1 : ℂ) * h x * basisValue B j l x) * basisValue B j l p\n\nend CellCalculus\n\nend CertCell\n\nend Breakdown\n"}